{"timestamp": 1779380766.312901, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 31, "data": {"caller": "player_4", "reason": "Eve reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "oxygen", "victim_name": "Charlie"}, {"room": "cafeteria", "victim_name": "Bob"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779380766.313622, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 31, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779380777.168236, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 31, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I just walked into Oxygen from Upper Engine and found Charlie's body, and Frank was standing right over it! I reported it immediately because I didn't want him to kill me too. Frank, why didn't you report it if you were innocent? Alice, it has to be Frank. We're down to three people, please vote Frank with me so we can win!"}}
{"timestamp": 1779380800.783235, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 31, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I didn\u2019t see Frank at all this round, so I can\u2019t confirm or deny him being in Oxygen. My route was lower engine \u2192 upper engine \u2192 medbay \u2192 storage \u2192 medbay \u2192 cafeteria \u2192 weapons. I saw Eve enter Upper Engine from Oxygen around tick 11, and later I saw Eve enter Cafeteria from Medbay around tick 25.\n\nEve\u2019s report location makes sense with her being around that side of the map, but since Frank gets to speak after me, I want to hear his explanation. Frank, were you actually standing on the body, and if so why didn\u2019t you report?"}}
{"timestamp": 1779380818.949075, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 31, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "Alice, this is a hard frame. I was not camping Charlie\u2019s body \u2014 I came up through lower engine to upper engine and then into Oxygen right at the end. Eve was also there, and she reported instantly before I even had a chance to react.\n\nMy route was electrical \u2192 cafeteria \u2192 weapons \u2192 security \u2192 navigation \u2192 storage \u2192 lower engine \u2192 upper engine. I saw Charlie way earlier in medbay at tick 2 with Eve also there. I also saw Eve in navigation around tick 20 coming from storage, and then Eve entered upper engine from medbay at tick 30.\n\nImportant: Eve has now reported both meetings, Diana first and now Charlie, and she\u2019s pushing extremely hard on me at final three. If I were the duck and standing on a body with Eve walking in, I\u2019d report first or run \u2014 I wouldn\u2019t just sit there. Eve is using the report to lock the vote.\n\nAlice, I\u2019m voting Eve. If you vote me, duck wins."}}
{"timestamp": 1779380828.32946, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 31, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "Frank"}}
{"timestamp": 1779380872.819392, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 31, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "My info is still that I only saw Eve this round: she came into Upper Engine from Oxygen around tick 11, and later I saw her enter Cafeteria from Medbay around tick 25. I never saw Frank, so I can\u2019t directly confirm his route.\n\nThe problem is both stories put both of you near Oxygen at the end. Frank admits he came through Upper Engine into Oxygen, and Eve says she entered from Upper Engine and found Charlie with Frank there. But Eve has reported both bodies now and is pushing very hard in final three, which makes me nervous.\n\nI don\u2019t think this is a safe skip at final three. I\u2019m leaning that this could be an Eve self-report/frame unless Frank\u2019s timing is impossible."}}
{"timestamp": 1779380884.6572502, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 31, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "Alice, the key thing is Eve\u2019s story relies on \u201cFrank was standing over it,\u201d but from my perspective I had just reached that area at the end and Eve hit report instantly. I did not get time to report.\n\nMy route was electrical \u2192 cafeteria \u2192 weapons \u2192 security \u2192 navigation \u2192 storage \u2192 lower engine \u2192 upper engine, then into Oxygen right as the report happened. I saw Charlie much earlier in medbay at tick 2 with Eve there too. I also saw Eve in navigation at tick 20 coming from storage, and then Eve entered upper engine from medbay at tick 30 \u2014 so Eve was moving around that whole side and had access to Oxygen/upper engine before the report.\n\nThe biggest red flag is Eve has reported both dead bodies this game, and now at final three she\u2019s instantly trying to force you onto me. If I were Duck and Eve walked in on me, I would either self-report first or leave \u2014 not just stand there waiting for her to report and accuse me.\n\nThis feels like a self-report/frame. Alice, please vote Eve with me. If you vote me, the Duck wins."}}
